fields.value:
 * Affects the following sources:
** {{M|Item}} abilities, from both active and passive abilities.
** {{M|Runes}}
** Self-applied {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} debuff sources, including the following sources:
*** {{A|Harpoon|Echo Strike}}
** Self-applied {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} buff sources from {{M|Spell Reflection}} sources.

* Doesn't affect duration of the following sources:
** {{A|Black King Bar|Avatar}}
** {{A|Bloodstone|Bloodpact}}
** {{A|Bottle|Regenerate}}
** {{A|Force Staff|Force}}-based items
** {{A|Mana Draught|Bottoms Up}}
** {{A|Psychic Headband|Psychic Push}}
** The duration of the following {{M|cyclone}} sources:
*** {{I|Eul's Scepter of Divinity}}
*** {{I|Wind Waker}}
** The stack limit duration of the following sources:
*** {{A|Crimson Guard|Guard}}
*** {{A|Mekansm|Restore}}
*** {{A|Guardian Greaves|Mend}}
*** {{A|Pipe of Insight|Barrier}}
<hr>
* {{cf|shdnotes}} The ability has the follow interactions with {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted modifiers.
** If the modifier source is self-cast, the modifier will be applied on an allied hero.
*** This interaction considers {{M|clones}} as heroes, {{M|illusions}} and {{M|creep-heroes}} as creeps.
** If the modifier source is cast on an allied hero, the modifier will be applied on Largo.
*** This interaction considers the {{H|Spirit Bear}} and {{M|Clones}} as heroes; {{M|illusions}} and other {{M|creep-heroes}} as creeps.
** For other multicast {{M|item}} abilities interactions:
*** {{A|Disperser|Suppress}} cast on the enemy unit grants both Largo and one other allied hero within the radius.
*** {{A|Solar Crest|Shine}} will not give extra armor, move speed or attack speed to Largo even if Largo used the ability on an ally.
*** Does not interact with the following sources:
**** {{I|Bottle}}
**** {{I|Enchanted Mango}}
**** {{A|Force Staff|Force}}-based items
**** {{I|Mana Draught}}
**** {{I|Moon Shard}}
**** {{I|Psychic Headband}}
**** {{M|Runes}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Encore icon0}}
| desc = Buffs that Largo applies to himself or his team have extended duration.
}}

