fields.value:
{{Debuffnotes
| name = Catchy Lick
| desc = Fully affects [[debuff immune]] allied units.
}}

 * {{Symbol|fx|v}}
** All ability effects are applied immediately despite the visual effects, and cannot be {{M|disjointed}}.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** {{M|Doubletap}} casts Catchy Lick on Largo.

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# An offensive {{M|basic dispel}} that dispels both {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} modifiers.
*# {{Symbol|Target|Unit}}
*#* Applies a non-disabling {{M|forced movement}} on the targeted unit.
*#* {{hi|Largo}} {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}} {{Symbol|Facing Angle|l}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
*#** {{Symbol|Turn Rate|Lock}} {{Symbol|fx|v}}
*#** Locks the targeted unit's {{M|facing angle}}.
*#** The affected unit is then forcefully {{M|Turn Rate|text=turned}} facing toward Largo.
*# {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*#* The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
*# {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*#* {{Symbol|Runes}}
*#** When cast on [[Runes]], refunds the {{Symbol|mp cost}} mana cost utilizing {{M|mana restore}}.
*#* {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|largo_catchy_lick_buff}}
*#** Applies one bonus {{M|health regeneration}} buff if Largo dispels any number of {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} modifiers.
*#** Reapplying the buff applies an independent instance.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Catchy Lick icon0}}
| desc = Largo licks the targeted unit with his tongue, pulling it back a short distance, applying a basic dispel, and dealing damage if it's an enemy.<br><br>Killing or dispelling an effect from a target grants Largo temporary health regeneration.
}}
* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** Utilizes a different ability animation when self-cast.

